# Git LFS — large binary assets (set up 2026-08-12 for the Beckholmen hi-res model).
# NOTE: requires `git lfs install` on every machine that clones this repo, or the
# .dae/.png files arrive as small text pointer files and Unity shows an empty mesh.
#
# Quota watch: GitHub's free tier is 1 GB LFS storage AND 1 GB/month bandwidth.
# DrydockHiRes is ~629 MB; every new revision of beckholmen_hires_dropin.dae
# costs another ~490 MB. If quota gets tight, the big .dae files are
# REGENERABLE from data-cube/scripts/beckholmen-hires/ — see that pipeline and
# Runtime/Models/DrydockHiRes/README.md before re-committing a new version.

*.dae   filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Only the oversized texture atlases — keep ordinary small PNGs in normal git
Runtime/Models/DrydockHiRes/*.png   filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Unity .meta files must stay as normal text (they are tiny and must diff)
*.meta  -filter -diff -merge text
